[IMG]http://static.blitzkrieg.com/news2015/STEAM070hotfixesEN.jpg[/IMG]

[h1]List of bug fixes:[/h1]
[list]
[*]Available historical missions playable without chronological restriction;
[*]Added loading screens with missions briefs;
[*]French and German localization received some fixes;
[*]An issue with the Faction selection has been fixed;
[*]Global map background sounds have been added;
[*]Temporary German voice-over added to Poland invasion mission; 
[*]Sdkfz 251’s damage against infantry has been adjusted (Poland);
[*]Polish tanks now are handed over to the commander by entering the area (Poland);
[*]Possibility to capture all 6 polish tanks was added (Poland);
[*]Cutscene have received some fixes (Poland);
[*]An issue with Radio tower reinforcements was fixed (Poland);
[*]The area size where player receive alarm message about armored vehicles was increased (Poland);  
[*]Vehicles” HP have been changed (Poland);
[*]An issue with Units getting stuck while moving should be fixed (Poland); 
[*]The Healthbars mispositioning was changed (Poland);
[*]An algorithm for rescuing coordinators in building was changed (Nivi);
[*]The amount of planes in the air was reduced (Nivi);
[*]Duplicated labels issue has been fixed (Nivi);
[*]The time of displaying tooltips was increased (Nivi);
[*]The amount of planes in the air was reduced (Sevastopol);
[*]The fighter aircraft was replaced to more historically correct variant (Sevastopol);
[*]An issue causing a long waiting time for the Defeat system message was fixed (Sevastopol);
[*]BA-20 infantry damage was increased (Sevastopol).
[/list]

