[h1]This patch resolves actual authorization and game-launch issues.[/h1]

[B]What’s  new.[/B]
* Your base can not be attacked if you haven’t played for more than 2 days (previously 7 days)
* Resource bonus after successful attack on enemy base increased by 50%;
* Depots produce more resources.
* English localization improvements
 
[B]Resolved issues.  [/B]
* Game freezes at 25% loading progress;
* Error message “This account is used on another PC”
 
[B]Known issues we are working on: [/B]
* Possible game crashes while constantly Alt-Tabbing; 
* Resources, required for attack, are taken away after battle ends. Now this information is not displayed in the game interface; 
* If player lose all his troops in attack, continue battle window can be displayed; 
* Button “End the Battle” need to be pressed twice; 
* Fortified Anti-tank infantry attack radius is lower than displayed; 
* Rare issue with dead troops standing as alive; 
* Rare issue with explosion craters are displayed not as expected while camera-rotating; 
* Defend bonus is given to infantry placed in building depends on landscape position of the building; 
* Mound around fortifications placed on the hills can be displayed incorrectly; 
* Localization issues; 
* Path-finding algorithm improvements.


